  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One Child One School Bag Project Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ongoing sociopolitical conflict in the English Speaking regions of Cameroon has had devastating effects on the economy of the population. Ahuge number of the affectedpopulation are children and young adults who have missed several years of school. Factors preventing these children from fully participating in schoolare; poverty, lack of didactic materials,inability to pay fees, loss of household bread winnersto the crisis. This project will provide school supplies, scholarships &amp;library.</narrative>
  </description>
